1
01:02:48,920 --> 01:02:50,200
Tapi mungkin tidak.

2
01:02:54,800 --> 01:02:57,360
Come on, let's focus and start a new chapter.

3
01:02:58,120 --> 01:03:00,520
For days, the murders were front-page news. the front pages of the newspapers.

4
01:03:01,840 --> 01:03:03,640
Lieutenant Anderson and his men,

5
01:03:04,520 --> 01:03:07,400
went through the house with a fine-tooth comb, without success.

6
01:03:08,120 --> 01:03:12,520
Warner had not been arrested, but he was being but his every move was being watched.

7
01:03:13,520 --> 01:03:17,640
At night, with the exception of one officer stationed in the manor,

8
01:03:17,840 --> 01:03:20,200
the police and reporters left us alone for a while.

9
01:03:20,480 --> 01:03:22,640
Just one of those nights,

10
01:03:23,400 --> 01:03:25,720
Without informing Lizzie or anyone else...

11
01:03:26,120 --> 01:03:29,720
I set out to do some research of my own. my own research.

12
01:03:38,000 --> 01:03:40,040
It was then that I entered an uninhabited an uninhabited room on the third floor.

13
01:03:40,160 --> 01:03:42,640
Where we had stored our trunks.

14
01:05:39,800 --> 01:05:41,760
Here lies the bat... Exposed to the light, it will destroy itself.

15
01:05:46,040 --> 01:05:47,440
Hands up high!

16
01:05:52,160 --> 01:05:54,280
Brilliant idea to kill myself in my laboratory

17
01:05:54,680 --> 01:05:56,720
to make everyone believe that the bat is me.

18
01:05:56,960 --> 01:05:58,680
But you should have killed me first.

19
01:05:59,000 --> 01:06:00,560
Did you plan an ambush?

20
01:06:02,040 --> 01:06:04,640
You're smart, but you don't have enough guts to get into this.

21
01:06:04,720 --> 01:06:06,720
Likewise, you've hit your goals,

22
01:06:06,840 --> 01:06:08,680
but you failed in the search for the loot.

23
01:06:08,960 --> 01:06:10,720
I know where it is hidden.

24
01:06:11,480 --> 01:06:14,680
And when you are dead with this confession on your chest,

25
01:06:15,040 --> 01:06:17,800
I will go and get it and live happy for the rest of my life.

26
01:06:19,360 --> 01:06:21,240
He destroyed himself.

27
01:06:21,680 --> 01:06:23,280
That couldn't be more true.

28
01:06:23,920 --> 01:06:25,120
Goodbye, bat.

29
01:06:26,240 --> 01:06:29,360
Here is a vaccine that will cure you whether you have rabies or not.

30
01:08:17,440 --> 01:08:18,960
Itu aneh!

31
01:08:21,000 --> 01:08:22,600
I'd even say it's weird.

32
01:08:51,360 --> 01:08:54,680
What could she be doing at this time of night?

33
01:09:07,120 --> 01:09:09,080
By all the saints in heaven!

34
01:09:17,440 --> 01:09:19,080
This is purely scandalous!

35
01:09:24,040 --> 01:09:26,320
Mr.Davenport!

36
01:09:27,440 --> 01:09:28,800
Finally, it's pretty good!

37
01:09:28,960 --> 01:09:32,640
The safety chain was not on and you sleep during the service!

38
01:09:33,240 --> 01:09:35,400
Wait until Lieutenant Anderson hears about this!

39
01:09:36,080 --> 01:09:38,200
Come on, get up! Apa sih yang salah dengan Anda?

40
01:09:38,360 --> 01:09:40,120
Saya tidak tahu.

41
01:09:40,240 --> 01:09:41,360
Aku sedang sakit kepala.

42
01:09:41,800 --> 01:09:43,000
My whole body is numb.

43
01:09:43,240 --> 01:09:44,720
Minum air.

44
01:09:44,840 --> 01:09:46,960
Try to come to your senses, I'll be right back.

45
01:10:01,120 --> 01:10:03,120
Buka! It's me, Lizzie.

46
01:10:04,840 --> 01:10:05,920
I'm terribly worried.

47
01:10:06,040 --> 01:10:07,880
I can't find Miss Cornelia anywhere.

48
01:10:08,160 --> 01:10:10,720
And something happened to the policeman, I don't know what yet,

49
01:10:10,840 --> 01:10:13,480
Wake Warner up. Tell him to come down to the parlor, we need him.

50
01:10:18,960 --> 01:10:21,520
- Are you okay now? - Yes, I'm starting to feel better.

51
01:10:22,440 --> 01:10:23,400
Aku ingat sekarang.

52
01:10:23,600 --> 01:10:25,600
I poured myself a glass of wine from that decanter there.

53
01:10:25,960 --> 01:10:27,160
Miss Van Gorder told me to serve myself.

54
01:10:27,680 --> 01:10:29,120
Are you suggesting that she drugged you? drugged you?

55
01:10:29,600 --> 01:10:32,440
Well, somebody did, somebody who knew I was on duty.

56
01:10:32,880 --> 01:10:35,160
And who also just took Miss Van Gorder!
